  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-17-a.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:17-a Filing Candidacy. –\n\nNo person shall file as a candidate for a town officer under the provisions of RSA 669:19 or RSA 669:42 for more than one seat on the same town or school district board, commission, committee, or council."
